# sriq ABox split (slice 9j): a property-assertion component that is inconsistent, beside folded
# individuals that are fine. r is functional, a r b and a r c, b : B and c : ¬B, so b = c clashes.
# d : D is folded. The consistency run (Run C) finds the clash.
# Expect: inconsistent.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:B a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class . :r a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual ; :r :b , :c .
:b a owl:NamedIndividual , :B .
:c a owl:NamedIndividual , [ owl:complementOf :B ] .
:d a owl:NamedIndividual , :D .
